POST http://localhost:8080/residents
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "山田太郎",
  "roomNumber": "101",
  "phone": "090-1234-5678"
}
### 修繕依頼登録
POST http://localhost:8080/repair-requests
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "residentId": 2,
  "category": "水漏れ",
  "description": "キッチンの蛇口から水が漏れています",
  "status": "未対応"
}
### 修繕依頼一覧
GET http://localhost:8080/repair-requests
### 修繕依頼詳細
GET http://localhost:8080/repair-requests/1
### 修繕依頼ステータス変更
PUT http://localhost:8080/repair-requests/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "対応中"
}
### 修繕依頼を対応済みに変更
PUT http://localhost:8080/repair-requests/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "対応済み"
}